<section id="Ax1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_font_bold ltx_title_appendix">Appendix</h2>

</section>
<section id="A1" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix A </span>Summary of OBR Algorithm</h2>

<div id="A1.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">In <a href="#alg1" title="In Appendix A Summary of OBR Algorithm ‣ Optimal Brain Restoration for Joint Quantization and Sparsification of LLMs" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">Algo.</span> <span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, we provide a detailed pseudocode to illustrate the process of obtaining joint low-bit and sparse LLM weights in the proposed OBR framework.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg1" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 1</span> </span> Optimal Brain Restoration (OBR)</figcaption>
<div id="alg1.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg1.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Input:</span>
Hadamard rotated weight matrix <math id="alg1.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}\in\mathbb{R}^{C_{out}\times C_{in}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐖</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}\in\mathbb{R}^{C_{out}\times C_{in}}</annotation></semantics></math>, Hessian approximation <math id="alg1.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{H}\in\mathbb{R}^{C_{in}\times C_{in}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐇</mi><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{H}\in\mathbb{R}^{C_{in}\times C_{in}}</annotation></semantics></math>, partitioning ratio <math id="alg1.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>α</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg1.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l2.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Output:</span> Low-bit and sparse weight <math id="alg1.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{\hat{W}}\in\mathbb{Z}^{C_{out}\times C_{in}}." display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐖</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>∈</mo><msup><mi>ℤ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msup></mrow><mo lspace="0em">.</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{\hat{W}}\in\mathbb{Z}^{C_{out}\times C_{in}}.</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l3.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#4F8080;">// Step1 Pruning</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <math id="alg1.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{M}\in\{0,1\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>𝐌</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{M}\in\{0,1\}</annotation></semantics></math> = <span id="alg1.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">prune</span>(<math id="alg1.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>𝐖</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <math id="alg1.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{W}^{prune}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}\odot\mathbf{M}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>𝐖</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⊙</mo><mi>𝐌</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{W}^{prune}\leftarrow\mathbf{W}\odot\mathbf{M}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#4F8080;">// Step2 OBR compensation</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           Initialize <math id="alg1.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{W}^{OBR}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msup><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>B</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{W}^{OBR}</annotation></semantics></math> as zero matrices in <math id="alg1.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbb{R}^{C_{out}\times C_{in}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msup><mi>ℝ</mi><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">×</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></msup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbb{R}^{C_{out}\times C_{in}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
           <span id="alg1.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg1.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="c=1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">c=1</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="alg1.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dots" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dots</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="alg1.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C_{out}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>C</mi><mrow><mi>o</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C_{out}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>



</div>
<div id="alg1.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l9.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#4F8080;">// OBR for pruning</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="R_{1}\leftarrow\{i\mid\mathbf{M}_{c,i}=1\},\quad E_{1}\leftarrow\{j\mid\mathbf{M}_{c,j}=0\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>i</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐌</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>j</mi><mo fence="true" lspace="0em" rspace="0em">∣</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐌</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">R_{1}\leftarrow\{i\mid\mathbf{M}_{c,i}=1\},\quad E_{1}\leftarrow\{j\mid\mathbf{M}_{c,j}=0\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{b}_{1}\leftarrow\mathbf{H}_{R_{1}E_{1}}\cdot\mathbf{W}_{c,E_{1}}^{\top}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐛</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐇</mi><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mo>⊤</mo></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{b}_{1}\leftarrow\mathbf{H}_{R_{1}E_{1}}\cdot\mathbf{W}_{c,E_{1}}^{\top}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{w}^{prune}_{R_{1}}\leftarrow-\mathbf{H}_{R_{1}R_{1}}^{-1}\mathbf{b}_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐇</mi><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐛</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{w}^{prune}_{R_{1}}\leftarrow-\mathbf{H}_{R_{1}R_{1}}^{-1}\mathbf{b}_{1}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l13.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\bar{\mathbf{w}}\leftarrow{\mathbf{W}}^{prune}_{c,R_{1}}+\Delta\mathbf{w}^{prune}_{R_{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐖</mi><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></msubsup><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>r</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>e</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\bar{\mathbf{w}}\leftarrow{\mathbf{W}}^{prune}_{c,R_{1}}+\Delta\mathbf{w}^{prune}_{R_{1}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#4F8080;">// OBR for quantization</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{e}^{quant}\leftarrow\bar{\mathbf{w}}-\texttt{quantize}(\bar{\mathbf{w}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>𝐞</mi><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo>−</mo><mrow><mtext class="ltx_mathvariant_monospace">quantize</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mover accent="true"><mi>𝐰</mi><mo>¯</mo></mover><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{e}^{quant}\leftarrow\bar{\mathbf{w}}-\texttt{quantize}(\bar{\mathbf{w}}</annotation></semantics></math>)

</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="t\leftarrow\lfloor\alpha\cdot|R_{1}|\rfloor" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌊</mo><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">⌋</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">t\leftarrow\lfloor\alpha\cdot|R_{1}|\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="E_{2}\leftarrow\{r_{1},\dots,r_{t}\},\quad R_{2}\leftarrow\{r_{t+1},\dots,r_{|R|}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><mo rspace="1.167em">,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">|</mo><mi>R</mi><mo stretchy="false">|</mo></mrow></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">E_{2}\leftarrow\{r_{1},\dots,r_{t}\},\quad R_{2}\leftarrow\{r_{t+1},\dots,r_{|R|}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathbf{b}_{2}\leftarrow\mathbf{H}_{R_{2}E_{2}}\cdot\mathbf{e}^{quant}_{E_{2}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>𝐛</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>𝐇</mi><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></msub><mo lspace="0.222em" rspace="0.222em">⋅</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐞</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathbf{b}_{2}\leftarrow\mathbf{H}_{R_{2}E_{2}}\cdot\mathbf{e}^{quant}_{E_{2}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <math id="alg1.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Delta\mathbf{w}^{quant}_{R_{2}}\leftarrow-\mathbf{H}_{R_{2}R_{2}}^{-1}\mathbf{b}_{2}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Δ</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msubsup><mi>𝐰</mi><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mrow><mi>q</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>u</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>a</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>t</mi></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi>𝐇</mi><mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>R</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><msub><mi>𝐛</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Delta\mathbf{w}^{quant}_{R_{2}}\leftarrow-\mathbf{H}_{R_{2}R_{2}}^{-1}\mathbf{b}_{2}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
            <span id="alg1.l20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#4F8080;">// Compensation Gathering</span>

</div>
<div id="alg1.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            
            
